WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Section and datum. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Read reference lines and cutaway views

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A datum gives multiple measurements a shared reference. A section view reveals internal relationships along a chosen plane.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Measure a component’s height from the same baseline on both drawings; the comparison is meaningful only if the datum matches.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Drawing markup

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Read reference lines and cutaway views
